    }
  ],
  "probe_note": "The booking probe is the 2024 file, mirroring the other provider's choice of the 2024 capture for the same reason: stay.rate_code and stay.amount appear on room stays there and on none of the 2026 ones. That is a fact about what this hotel recorded when, not about either wire format, and it is why a probe is named per mapping rather than assumed."
}
